  "Solution": {
    "S": "Using Kirchhoff's Current Law (KCL):\n\nAt first junction: $I_1 = 20 - 15 = 5$ A.\n\nAt second junction: $I_2 = 5 + 3 = 8$ A.\n\nAt third junction: $I_3 = 15 - 5 = 10$ A.\n\nTotal current $I = I_2 + I_3 = 8 + 10 = 18$ A.\n\nThus the correct option is C: 18 A."
  },
